  <text x="24" y="347" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="#8CA0BC">1,152 contribs · 31/53 wks active</text>

