  <text x="24" y="332" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-style="italic" fill="#D5DEEC">Active 31/53 weeks - immune to status effects</text>
  <text x="24" y="347" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="#8CA0BC">326 contribs · 31/53 wks active</text>

